WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.790
Demons: inhuman beings from the depths of Hell.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:15.880
They bring about calamity and
defy all laws of reason and logic.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:22.460
They adore the darkness, the night, lust,
and flame, and curse all that is human.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.460
Yet despite knowing that...

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.580
...I still can't help but think...

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.250
...that she's wonderful.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:12.920
THE DESPERATE MAGICIAN AND THE IMPRISONED DISASTER

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.830
Alto Goldfield, I'm sure you're already expecting this
result, but your score on the summoning exam...

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.130
ALTO GOLDFIELD

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.130
FIRST-YEAR

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.130
AT THE

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.130
ORTIGIA ACADEMY

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.130
OF MAGIC

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.960
...is zero points.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:37.080
It pains me to say that,
despite your perfect scores in all other fields,

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:41.830
you cannot advance to your second year
if you cannot form a contract with a familiar.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.750
Forming a contract with a familiar
needn't be such a large hurdle.

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:50.790
Some students have passed
by forming contracts with rhinoceros beetles.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:56.000
Unfortunately, unless you can successfully
summon something, there is nothing I can do.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:02.880
You must form a contract with a familiar
before tomorrow's faculty meeting.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.710
Or else you will repeat the year.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:09.210
How'd it go, Alto?!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.170
Lilia...

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.710
What'd the teacher say?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.080
LILIA

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.080
KUDELFEYT

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:19.040
I have to make a contract with something
by tomorrow, or I'll get held back.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.920
Wh-what?!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.830
I'm going to give him a piece of my mind!

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:27.170
Hold on, Lilia! At least put the rock down first!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:32.630
He's right. Second-years need familiars
for tons of class activities.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.170
I know, but are you just gonna accept this?!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.710
You worked so hard all year...

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.500
This is the Ortigia Royal Academy of Magic.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:51.290
I studied my butt off to get in,
then worked even harder to do well...

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.080
But this is the one thing I can't pass.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:04:00.000
I mean, he gave me an extension until tomorrow,
so I'm gonna give it another shot!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:04.210
Let me know if I can help at all!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.460
Thanks.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.540
I said I'd give it another shot...

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:15.130
But I already TRIED summoning beetles.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.040
What else is left for me to try?

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.540
Compatibility is essential for successful summoning!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.460
Maybe I should try summoning something
really weid or unique this time.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.420
Ow!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:41.790
A book?

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.500
Where'd it come from?

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:52.920
What if it's a weird summoning book
that just HAPPENED to fall on me?

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.920
It looks pretty old.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.250
Yes! It IS a book of summoning magic!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:07.920
It's pretty beat up, though,
so I have no idea what it'll summon.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.580
Hey, the magic circle is still legible!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.000
Please work for me!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.670
By bonds of blood and the moon as thy guide,

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.790
Drink of mana, of life, and become my thrall,

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.130
To partake in the universe by my side,

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.710
Bid me thy name and heed my call.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:38.330
Huh?! I-it's never worked before!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.080
Yes!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.210
I-if thou desirest my blood, then bid me thy name!

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:50.880
My blood is yours!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.420
I did it! I summoned something!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:21.000
Are you the one who let me out of there?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.460
Um, uh...

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:27.460
She's not human... So what did I summon?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.040
Forget that, right now she's-

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:32.500
You're...

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.540
You're naked!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.960
Aww, look at you, you sweet, innocent thing!

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.330
Ow!

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:55.250
What, did you not know who I was
when you summoned me?

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:58.960
You want me to do something for you, right?

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.710
Um, uh...

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.250
Go on, tell me.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.420
I'll do WHATEVER you want.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:08.920
What the hell?! How did I end up like this?!

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.130
What do I want her to do?

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.750
I... I want...

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.500
I want you to be my familiar!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:20.790
What?

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:36.630
How is his mana so potent?

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.540
I formed a contract...

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.380
That you did.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.130
Well, a contract is a contract.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:59.330
In exchange, I'll be helping myself to some of your mana.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.710
She's draining my mana!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:22.790
I am Vermeil, and I am what you would call a demon.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.000
I do hope you'll be kind to me, Master.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.750
I'm your master...?

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.710
Command me as much or as often as you like.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:38.420
I'll do ANYTHING you want.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.210
Anything?

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.790
Then...

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.750
...could you please put on some clothes?!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.000
What?!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:55.210
You strange little creature.
You'd really prefer me in clothing?

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.670
Oh! Unless you're a kinky wolf in shy sheep's clothing?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.790
Can we stop talking about that?!

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:04.460
I would, but not much
that fits your small stature will fit me.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:08.710
I accidentally brought some of my sister's clothes!
You can wear those!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.250
They're in the bottom drawer!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.130
Will this do?

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.460
Yes, that'll do!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.580
And so, after my first successful attempt at summoning,

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.670
I found myself in THIS crazy situation.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:36.580
Hmm. I see. This is an academy of magic.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.920
And that's how a sweet boy like you
summoned me here?

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:43.830
What a fun story this is turning out to be.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.460
Though it makes sense.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:51.330
With the mana you possess,
most familiars wouldn't dare approach you.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:51.960
Huh?

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.750
My, you're not aware?

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.920
Your mana is extremely potent.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.170
"Too potent" would be far more accurate.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.750
To most beings, it's as lethal as poison.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.170
I-is that why...?

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.210
I like it nice and potent, however.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:13.670
U-um... Vermeil, you're a demon, right?

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.420
That's right.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:22.670
I'm an evil demon. A VERY naughty woman.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:28.080
Demons are powerful illusionary beings
that have been feared by mankind for eons.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:33.080
Some demons have destroyed
entire nations all on their lonesome.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.880
U-um, if you see what I'm like,
then why'd you decide to be my familiar?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.130
Why?

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:41.290
I mean, you could break the contract if you wanted...

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:43.670
That's true.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.670
Frankly, I could have killed you right then and there.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:49.420
Huh?!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:59.540
But I was trapped in that book for a very long time,
and you helped me escape.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.170
So technically, I owe you.
Being your familiar's a cheap price to pay for freedom.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.040
Wh-why did someone trap you in there?

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:09.210
Oh, are you interested?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.170
Do you want to know why I was sealed away?

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:19.670
Because I did LOTS of naughty things.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:23.960
But can a demon really be my familiar?!

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:27.290
Vermeil, you're a bad guy, right?

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:31.250
A bad guy? I'm a BAD GUY?!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.830
Sorry, I didn't mean to be rude!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.580
It's just such a cute way to put it!

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.500
But yes, you're right.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:53.170
So this thing-er, person, is your familiar?

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:54.830
Yeah, I know...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:12:00.420
Alto Goldfield, I know you were desperate
to advance a grade,

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:03.000
but claiming a human woman is your familiar
is a step too far.

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.540
You know we don't allow guests on campus.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.000
Are you deaf?!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.460
I told you, I'm Alto's familiar!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.830
You teach summoning magic,
you should know what it looks like!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.040
See?!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:22.500
Y-yes, that is a familiar's contract,
not a spell of servitude.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.380
But never in the annals of history
has a human made another human their-

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.380
Who cares?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:34.170
I didn't want to be summoned to some weird place,
either, so buck up and say I'm his familiar!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.290
V-very well.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:41.630
Alto Goldfield, with this, I can say
that you pass your summoning exam.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:46.460
Yay, now I can be a second year!

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:46.460
Of course!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.580
Just one thing.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:52.960
Are you truly amenable to this arrangement?
To being his familiar?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:57.380
Eh, it's too late to turn back now. I don't mind.

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.420
All right. Get back to your seat.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:04.380
Yay!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.330
Who the HELL is she?!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:14.630
Hey, Vermeil? When we're at school, could you, uh...

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.080
C'mon, it's no big deal.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.380
I can't help it...

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:24.880
What is wrong with Alto?!
I was up all night worried sick about him!

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:28.750
Master Goldfield, would you be so kind
as to refrain from that behavior during class?

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:31.630
Good! Get them to stop right now!

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:37.380
Oh? So many other students have their familiars
sitting on top of them.

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:40.710
Yet you're going to pick on poor Alto? You monster.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:46.040
And isn't one of the school's doctrines
is "Live life alongside your familiar"?

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.790
Please turn your attention back to the tomes before you...

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:51.380
We win!

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:53.580
Give me a break, here...

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:55.750
You haven't beaten me yet!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.960
I'll admit, I'm glad he'll be able
to advance to the next grade with me...

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:05.460
C'mon, Alto, give me some more of that thick,
potent stuff inside of you!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:05.960
Now...

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:10.250
Now hold on a second! What are you two doing?!

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:16.420
Lilia Kudelfeyt, go stand in the hall.

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:20.420
I REFUSE to accept this!

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:28.880
Alto! What the hell is up with THAT?!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.540
Who is this woman?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.080
I could ask the same of you!

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:36.380
Just who the hell is she?!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:42.380
You think you should pretend to be a human?

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:48.080
Yes. I know it's strange coming from me,
but many humans despise demons,

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.380
academies of magic all the moreso.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:59.540
Luckily, average mages cannot see through my veil.
All I need to do is hide my horns.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.170
This will make things easier for you, and for me, too.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.500
So...

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:09.250
This is Vermeil. She's my familiar.

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.000
I'm Alto's familiar!

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.630
And that's why I'm asking what the hell is going on!

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.500
Huh? L-Lilia?! H-hold on a second...

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:26.920
Alto...

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:28.750
I challenge you!

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.710
Let's resolve this with a duel!

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:37.540
If I win, you will leave that lascivious familiar of yours
in your room unless needed!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.250
A duel?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:43.960
Um, how do I put it. It's a school thing...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:57.420
Formal Duels

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:57.420
Ortigia Academy of Magic,

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:57.420
Statute 7: Dueling Etiquette

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:57.420
Conflicts between students are to be resolved via

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:57.420
strictly-regulated duel to prevent discord

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:51.830
Formal Duels. Ortigia Academy of Magic,
Statute 7: Dueling Etiquette.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:57.420
Conflicts between students are to be resolved
via strictly-regulated duel to prevent discord.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:01.330
So the loser has to do whatever the winner says?

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.580
Exactly! You won't be hanging off him like that
for much longer!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:09.960
Now what? Lilia's never been one to compromise...

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.750
Why compromise? Just duel her.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:18.460
If we win, then you'll have to do whatever Alto wants!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:24.170
It's only fair. Just one request from him. Sound good?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.580
Wh-whatever he wants?

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.130
But, but we're still just students!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.710
But, but if Alto wanted...

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.210
No, I couldn't!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.580
No, c'mon, you dummy...

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.080
Wait a sec!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.960
Fine! You're on!

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:06.630
Familiars are allowed to participate in duels,
but if you don't want to get hurt, you'd better step aside!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.130
Summon!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:20.330
Let's go, Sylpheed! Let's punish that big dummy!

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.540
Wow, she can summon
a high-class wind spirit at her age?

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:28.130
Our combined spellcasting is extremely powerful!

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:32.420
You're tough, but not tough enough to dodge this
without a familiar's help!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.170
Give up, Alto!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:35.750
And while you're at it...

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.790
...tell me everything about that woman!

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:42.380
Lilia! That could seriously hurt!

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:45.170
Shut up and take it!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.080
Block! Dodge!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.290
No, I don't have time!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:50.580
Vermeil?!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.920
I'd love it if you could trust me a little more.

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:55.420
You ARE my master, after all.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:56.880
No-! Watch out!

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:06.330
Yes, a direct hit! I hope you learned your lesson!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:25.670
How...?

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.040
Was that all for your attack?

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:36.710
Then it's my turn now, little girl.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:40.830
What?

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:42.460
No!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:51.630
LILIA KUDELFEYT: LOSE

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:51.080
Lilia Kudelfeyt loses!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.210
All right, we won!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.080
You have to listen to us now.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:06.040
I-I know.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.670
I managed to keep my lips safe...

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.920
I-I have no choice.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.580
I'll do whatever you say.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:20.710
Only because I have no choice.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:25.130
I lost, after all. I really have no choice!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.880
I want you to be friends with Vermeil!

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.170
Huh...?

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.830
Same goes for you, Vermeil! No fighting!

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:39.880
What? But I didn't do anything.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:42.080
I said, no fighting!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.250
And promises made after duels cannot be broken!

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:46.710
F-fine, then...

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:54.130
I can't say no to Alto, anyway. I'll be friends with you.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.080
Let's be friends, ma'am!

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:08.040
"Ma'am"? That's a funny thing to say,
especially after I CRUSHED you.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.880
You're pretty strong, MA'AM.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:13.880
I hope they really CAN be friends...

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.960
I'm exhausted after a day like today.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.420
Could you please try not to cause trouble?

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:24.790
Aww, you know it wasn't all my fault.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:27.250
That girl's in love with you, you know.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.960
No way. She's just an old friend.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.250
And lately she's always mad at me
for the weirdest things.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.710
But she can be nice sometimes.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.920
I did pretty well back there. Don't I deserve a treat?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.580
Huh? A treat?

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.710
A little bit of your mana.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:53.580
Um, uh, Vermeil?!

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:05.580
Wh-why do you even need to drain my mana
in the first place?

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:08.210
Oh, about that.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:14.330
Being sealed away for centuries
has made me quite weak.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:18.920
Frankly, without you, I probably wouldn't be able
to retain a physical form.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.290
Whoa, really?!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:25.170
But your mana is especially potent.
It's a real big help, you know.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.000
Yeah, I know THAT.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:32.040
I thought contracting with a demon would be scary,
but it's just kind of normal.

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.500
Like, I'm getting so much for so little.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:37.000
Oh, please, it's not normal at all.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:42.460
Normal humans couldn't handle our power,
even with a contract.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:46.880
Either they burst from the inside
or die from having their mana completely drained.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:50.500
That's what happens when you sell your soul to a demon.

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:56.080
But you have what it takes
for a demon to want to serve you.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.040
If kissing is too annoying...

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:04.880
There are more effective ways of draining your mana.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.580
Want to give it a go?

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:11.420
I'm fine with kisses, thank you!
